   "id": "0bc4100a-a7d5-09bb-fa34-d1f1406f795c",
   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"sub-heading-text\">Pure Matcha Partners supplies bulk matcha powder for supplement brands, nutraceutical companies, and wellness manufacturers across the USA, UK, and international markets, supported by a reliable <a class=\"link-26\" data-wf-link-page-id=\"698ed39e8999d2a9cf8e7e17\" data-w-id=\"9b0213e2-8105-bbcd-369e-71c6cb835763\">bulk matcha powder supplier</a> model for regulated product categories.<br data-w-id=\"27d16717-4240-f5ac-469c-782eec7b86fb\"><br data-w-id=\"1df39c68-6a44-5ff5-529d-f04396c3904c\">Our ingredient-grade matcha is designed for capsules, powder blends, functional supplements, and nutraceutical formulations, with full laboratory testing and export-ready documentation.<br data-w-id=\"0020bfb1-8f57-4ec1-4030-127c1ae66096\"><br data-w-id=\"2733108f-08cd-4512-4cfc-621bff495551\">Whether you produce capsules, superfood powders, or functional wellness products, we provide certified matcha ingredients built for commercial scale.</p>",
    "text": "Pure Matcha Partners supplies bulk matcha powder for supplement brands, nutraceutical companies, and wellness manufacturers across the USA, UK, and international markets, supported by a reliable bulk matcha powder supplier model for regulated product categories.\n\nOur ingredient-grade matcha is designed for capsules, powder blends, functional supplements, and nutraceutical formulations, with full laboratory testing and export-ready documentation.\n\nWhether you produce capsules, superfood powders, or functional wellness products, we provide certified matcha ingredients built for commercial scale."
   },
