  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "1be82389-7dd5-0468-91d3-2054bef0f170",
   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"text-custom-gray\"><strong class=\"bold-text-19\" data-w-id=\"965cd1f0-3c55-9dd7-776b-1a884a12a649\">Fine-milled powder suitable for encapsulation and tablet compression.<br data-w-id=\"60dfa9f0-b054-224b-4c42-46b81dcd4307\"><br data-w-id=\"8bb98a2c-f410-aad4-30ea-48f7bb856398\">Best for:<br data-w-id=\"4325380b-837c-31ba-9d8c-3b1aacd6391f\">- Matcha capsules<br data-w-id=\"d58c37c8-5a45-f2c3-55f7-c03378357536\">- Green tea powder supplements<br data-w-id=\"b1de0a7f-e273-d619-863c-c8795c8b4356\">- Energy &amp; focus formulas<br data-w-id=\"4468302a-eee5-8b7d-6490-9e4d93447d1e\">- Weight management blends<br data-w-id=\"950c752a-590e-58d2-24c2-8a9e2293918d\"><br data-w-id=\"839d24c0-e1a6-b531-e72e-110959ac11a0\">Features:<br data-w-id=\"cadb3987-d4b9-5e17-cad6-8e9b72db9dd4\">- Consistent particle size<br data-w-id=\"b8e0b43b-ec06-c4f7-42d4-292ba3e07133\">- Stable caffeine levels<br data-w-id=\"8d19ac8c-131d-641e-6516-abfe391aa242\">- Lab-tested for heavy metals &amp; pesticides<br data-w-id=\"a93910f7-f35b-92b8-9105-ca78115c1a37\">- COAs available per batch</strong></p>",
    "text": "Fine-milled powder suitable for encapsulation and tablet compression.\n\nBest for:\n- Matcha capsules\n- Green tea powder supplements\n- Energy & focus formulas\n- Weight management blends\n\nFeatures:\n- Consistent particle size\n- Stable caffeine levels\n- Lab-tested for heavy metals & pesticides\n- COAs available per batch"
   },
