   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"text-custom-gray\">Certified organic matcha suitable for USDA &amp; EU organic supplement lines.<br data-w-id=\"356327a1-33f5-8686-9731-84e2022ede5e\"><br data-w-id=\"4f49f3f3-499e-7a31-dcdb-6f1e26112c62\">Best for:<br data-w-id=\"63523d2a-92cd-1b93-48f5-ad3c6fe5572b\">- Organic supplement brands<br data-w-id=\"17207619-a42a-9fc5-dc87-ebdb29b4cdae\">- Clean-label formulations<br data-w-id=\"c2400c16-3157-bcf7-57fa-ee7054a0d659\">- Export-focused nutraceutical products<br data-w-id=\"aa3aae88-66d6-3394-9c81-d1c584f992c5\"><br data-w-id=\"ff79dbfc-2e49-7811-4a5c-0f6c64a13eb3\">Certifications available:<br data-w-id=\"4f6f8418-af1d-f0e7-0538-db2c8e142987\">- USDA Organic<br data-w-id=\"4d322d70-17f1-1028-9b1f-1236ee222859\">- EU Organic<br data-w-id=\"81237b72-aaf2-abcb-8eec-a95163109a91\">- JAS<br data-w-id=\"e8233d8c-d05f-13c3-682e-4ce4f4969915\">- HACCPFSSC <br data-w-id=\"cdea49cd-ff9c-5562-3a44-8b5f752e7c03\">- 22000Kosher</p>",
    "text": "Certified organic matcha suitable for USDA & EU organic supplement lines.\n\nBest for:\n- Organic supplement brands\n- Clean-label formulations\n- Export-focused nutraceutical products\n\nCertifications available:\n- USDA Organic\n- EU Organic\n- JAS\n- HACCPFSSC \n- 22000Kosher"
