   "id": "88cf36a3-04af-c82e-b4e2-b67ac646618e",
   "text": {
    "html": "<h2 class=\"heading-5\">Certified &amp; lab-tested matcha ingredient supply</h2>",
    "text": "Certified & lab-tested matcha ingredient supply"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "c3edf8cc-566e-7f03-7bc6-d6bbda02a93b",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"text-block-75\"><strong data-w-id=\"977e704a-0496-1817-c8db-0ceb775f2e80\">All bulk matcha powder is tested for:<br data-w-id=\"d9af66d2-7220-f0b3-c2a5-1f6f8b9f7567\"></strong>- Heavy metals<br data-w-id=\"17832dfe-188a-4366-159c-e554640fa699\">- Pesticide residues<br data-w-id=\"f48aed47-49ee-cce9-6a24-31a96029987d\">- Microbiological safety<br data-w-id=\"d022af3d-0288-f219-6792-e9a367c6b3ad\">- Radiation (upon request)<br data-w-id=\"0108bf3e-d2bf-761b-7b2e-34d2b13d0637\">- Allergen compliance<strong data-w-id=\"a03bde5e-ce78-b1cd-ed02-a5620bca6137\"><br data-w-id=\"6fbc3b3e-0de5-2941-7311-99bebd2e7fbc\"><br data-w-id=\"fbfe7e06-4698-6c9f-490f-455c6b3136d6\">Documentation includes:<br data-w-id=\"bf1a794b-4a53-922f-20ac-0ef32fe83ed9\"></strong>- Certificate of Analysis (COA)<br data-w-id=\"1c19d804-a4aa-889e-31d8-0bcb0adb8910\">- Specification sheets<br data-w-id=\"2b5a77bd-14c0-af1f-c3a4-c09e7386f336\">- Export documents<br data-w-id=\"f3e0f80e-39cd-ee0e-8d5a-8704e0705f4a\">- Organic certification copies<br data-w-id=\"44729f4c-0d1e-6fce-d29c-b759f5c5d44d\"><br data-w-id=\"f1f55dd7-28c4-7669-7ec0-84350af72450\">We align with supplement industry quality standards and international trade requirements.</div>",
    "text": "All bulk matcha powder is tested for:\n- Heavy metals\n- Pesticide residues\n- Microbiological safety\n- Radiation (upon request)\n- Allergen compliance\n\nDocumentation includes:\n- Certificate of Analysis (COA)\n- Specification sheets\n- Export documents\n- Organic certification copies\n\nWe align with supplement industry quality standards and international trade requirements."
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
