   "id": "09ed1faa-f038-8aeb-9737-f67d5cc69b61",
   "text": {
    "html": "<h1 class=\"heading-5-2\"><span class=\"text-span-6\" data-w-id=\"6ce76778-945c-bf3d-31f4-60adfde7db6d\"><strong class=\"bold-text-18\" data-w-id=\"ab73c94b-57d3-d99d-9372-b3a98762a615\">Why </strong></span><strong class=\"bold-text-18\" data-w-id=\"afb1e830-0b86-1fc1-d707-29abb52a35ee\">Suppelement Brands</strong><span class=\"text-span-6\" data-w-id=\"afb1e830-0b86-1fc1-d707-29abb52a35f0\"><strong class=\"bold-text-18\" data-w-id=\"afb1e830-0b86-1fc1-d707-29abb52a35ef\"> Work with us</strong></span></h1>",
    "text": "Why Suppelement Brands Work with us"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "09ed1faa-f038-8aeb-9737-f67d5cc69b66",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"text-block-75-2\"><strong data-w-id=\"e56920e7-4b00-868b-14c9-079678c654ef\">Ingredient consistency across batches<br data-w-id=\"65575a3b-ee34-d759-c63b-8b356ab8be6f\"></strong>Stable caffeine and catechin profiles.<br data-w-id=\"10f63699-5d0b-4a76-55b2-1a3ce4d5383b\"><strong data-w-id=\"785d110d-3a83-c4f4-13a4-db513adfb472\">‍<br data-w-id=\"f96ce3dd-4468-94ce-791b-6aa2afc15b1e\">Regulatory-ready documentation<br data-w-id=\"65575a3b-ee34-d759-c63b-8b356ab8be74\"></strong>Full traceability and testing documentation.<br data-w-id=\"5b5da9ad-db48-1dc7-38a6-6ad4e5a91f8f\"><strong data-w-id=\"ce0a5504-37b7-957d-63db-fcf825b5ab82\">‍<br data-w-id=\"92f993b9-7630-8889-504c-0557b13b8170\">Flexible annual programs<br data-w-id=\"65575a3b-ee34-d759-c63b-8b356ab8be79\"></strong>Starting from 100kg per year with scalable growth options.<br data-w-id=\"abbe59c9-644a-e8f3-c855-87384a39658c\"><strong data-w-id=\"6660b935-8299-3eec-6eb8-daa8f9876168\"><br data-w-id=\"6bf9917f-0555-4f2c-ba90-5b195e3c85b6\">Global sourcing flexibility<br data-w-id=\"65575a3b-ee34-d759-c63b-8b356ab8be7e\"></strong>Japan and China origin options depending on grade and pricing structure.<br data-w-id=\"f33530da-2f7c-12f8-108e-d582ad8b72a4\"><strong data-w-id=\"0442a4ea-c928-8b84-6f83-fed9f097d2cc\"><br data-w-id=\"9ea7d422-26a8-b339-d09a-638b01f38554\">Long-term supply stability<br data-w-id=\"65575a3b-ee34-d759-c63b-8b356ab8be83\"></strong>Ideal for subscription-based supplement brands.<br data-w-id=\"b79cceb3-9ea6-8e28-ce7f-30afa4b0f0ac\"></div>",
    "text": "Ingredient consistency across batches\nStable caffeine and catechin profiles.\n‍\nRegulatory-ready documentation\nFull traceability and testing documentation.\n‍\nFlexible annual programs\nStarting from 100kg per year with scalable growth options.\n\nGlobal sourcing flexibility\nJapan and China origin options depending on grade and pricing structure.\n\nLong-term supply stability\nIdeal for subscription-based supplement brands.\n"
   },
   "attributes": {}
