   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c25",
   "text": {
    "html": "<h2 class=\"pricing-h1 faq-h2\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>",
    "text": "Frequently Asked Questions"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c2c",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"faq-q-text\"><strong data-w-id=\"633b8bdb-f5bb-b199-827b-b68daaa1d85c\">Is your matcha suitable for capsules?</strong></div>",
    "text": "Is your matcha suitable for capsules?"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c2f",
   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"faq-answer-text\">Yes — our fine-milled ingredient-grade matcha is suitable for encapsulation and powder formulations.</p>",
    "text": "Yes — our fine-milled ingredient-grade matcha is suitable for encapsulation and powder formulations."
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c36",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"faq-q-text\"><strong data-w-id=\"02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c37\">Do you provide COAs and lab testing?</strong></div>",
    "text": "Do you provide COAs and lab testing?"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c3a",
   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"faq-answer-text\">Yes — each batch includes heavy metal and pesticide testing documentation.</p>",
    "text": "Yes — each batch includes heavy metal and pesticide testing documentation."
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c41",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"faq-q-text\"><strong data-w-id=\"a1876ad2-e302-c8b9-220a-0d8a8e42730d\">Do you supply organic matcha for supplements?</strong></div>",
    "text": "Do you supply organic matcha for supplements?"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c44",
   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"faq-answer-text\">Yes — USDA and EU organic certified options are available.</p>",
    "text": "Yes — USDA and EU organic certified options are available."
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c51",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"faq-q-text\"><strong data-w-id=\"1c30d662-92bf-4e4f-944d-31563ae474e3\">Next to europe do you also ship to the US and UK?</strong></div>",
    "text": "Next to europe do you also ship to the US and UK?"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c54",
   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"faq-answer-text\">Yes — we ship to the US, UK, and other international markets.</p>",
    "text": "Yes — we ship to the US, UK, and other international markets."
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c5e",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"faq-q-text\"><strong data-w-id=\"b1c98fda-0a4e-4cbf-b039-5b8a962765b1\">What is the minimum order volume?</strong></div>",
    "text": "What is the minimum order volume?"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "02f79e4c-2b25-afc8-d2a4-fd109c696c61",
   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"faq-answer-text\">Programs typically start from 100kg annually.</p>",
    "text": "Programs typically start from 100kg annually."
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "ecbc48e7-570f-5232-1ec4-ef9889c24599",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"faq-q-text\"><strong data-w-id=\"ecbc48e7-570f-5232-1ec4-ef9889c2459a\">Is your matcha suitable for supplement and nutraceutical production at scale?</strong></div>",
    "text": "Is your matcha suitable for supplement and nutraceutical production at scale?"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "ecbc48e7-570f-5232-1ec4-ef9889c2459d",
   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"faq-answer-text\">Yes. Our <a data-wf-link-page-id=\"698ed39e8999d2a9cf8e7e17\" data-w-id=\"c04e2f99-470e-2566-dcbd-5f66d40ab8be\">scalable bulk matcha supply</a> supports supplement and wellness manufacturers with consistent specifications, batch-level testing, and documentation suitable for international distribution.</p>",
    "text": "Yes. Our scalable bulk matcha supply supports supplement and wellness manufacturers with consistent specifications, batch-level testing, and documentation suitable for international distribution."
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "ea8a1a39-2a44-8ea3-feed-848f29af9a1b",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"text-size-large-4 text-weight-semibold\">Ready to get <span class=\"text-span-47\" data-w-id=\"af4300d8-917e-1505-83d8-8a5101132418\">started</span>?</div>",
    "text": "Ready to get started?"
   },
   "attributes": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "ea8a1a39-2a44-8ea3-feed-848f29af9a1e",
   "text": {
    "html": "<p class=\"text-size-regular\">We're here to help you choose the perfect matcha for your café, coffee shop, gym, or office. Get expert advice tailored to your industry and start serving premium matcha today.</p>",
    "text": "We're here to help you choose the perfect matcha for your café, coffee shop, gym, or office. Get expert advice tailored to your industry and start serving premium matcha today."
   },
